<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Mercury Finance raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Mercury Finance raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- NatWest Securities said it raised Mercury Finance Co to accumulate from hold</p>
<p>-- Analyst says remains comfortable with EPS view of $0.20 in Q3, $0.80 for fiscal 1996.  EPS view for 1997 is $1.00.</p>
<p>-- One-year target price is $14-$15/shr based on 12 times preliminary 1998 estimate of $1.20/shr</p>
<p>-- Mercury Finance off 1/8 to 10-1/2 in late morning.</p>
</text>
